      "message": "In this patch on the write operation, this line is actually don\u0027t care since we do not update the hardware register for write.\n\nMy original thought on this was that the host may want to read back the value right after the write operation to validate the memap is in fact written, but this will mean one extra IO read, which will increase the execution time on the host side.",
